message: "If you use this repository, please cite the associated research manuscript and the repository version you used."
title: "Radiology Report Lay Summarization Using Parameter-Efficient Fine-Tuning and Explanation-Aware Knowledge Selection"
type: software
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-30
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/<GITHUB-OWNER>/radiology-report-lay-summarization"
abstract: >-
  Research code scaffold for text-to-text radiology report lay summarization
  using compact language models, QLoRA, terminology retrieval, and
  explanation-aware knowledge selection. The current release includes
  documentation and templates; original experiment notebooks and raw results
  were not available when it was assembled.
authors:
